    <string name="battery_power_profile">Battery profile controls</string>
    <string name="battery_profile_body">On Android 13 and newer, ApexTuner\'s Battery profile only shortens the screen timeout to at most 30 seconds. On Android 12L and earlier, it can also disable the legacy global haptic-feedback setting. It does not enable Android Battery Saver, force Doze, change CPU/GPU behavior, disable radios, or pause global sync. ApexTuner stores the exact original managed values for Restore Balanced.</string>
